{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/centres

    The centres of the site: each with its team and who waits for an answer, and a new one. Each centre is a row of its
    own, its name first and its settings at the side (under it on a phone), never a table: it fits from 320 px (Jujol,
    17 November 2026).

    Example context (json):
    {"hascentres": true, "newurl": "#", "sesskey": "abc",
     "centres": [{"name": "Colegio de ejemplo", "url": "#", "settingsurl": "#", "members": 2, "waiting": 3}]}
}}
<div class="eguahe">
    <form class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 align-items-end mb-3" method="post" action="{{newurl}}">
        <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
        <div><label class="form-label" for="eguahe-nuevo">{{#str}}centre_new_name, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</label>
            <input class="form-control" id="eguahe-nuevo" name="name" required></div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">{{#str}}centre_new, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</button>
    </form>
    {{#hascentres}}
    <ul class="eguahe-centres-list">
        {{#centres}}
        <li class="eguahe-centre">
            <div class="eguahe-centre-what">
                <a class="eguahe-centre-name" href="{{url}}">{{name}}</a>
                <span class="eguahe-centre-facts">{{#str}}centre_members, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}} <strong>{{members}}</strong> · {{#str}}inbox_filter_waiting, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}} <strong>{{waiting}}</strong></span>
            </div>
            <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm eguahe-centre-settings" href="{{settingsurl}}">{{#str}}settings{{/str}}<span class="visually-hidden"> · {{name}}</span></a>
        </li>
        {{/centres}}
    </ul>
    {{/hascentres}}
    {{^hascentres}}<div class="eguahe-empty"><p>{{#str}}centres_none, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p></div>{{/hascentres}}
</div>
